    - data:
        context:
          enabled: true
          variable_selector:
          - '1774203856189'
          - content
        model:
          completion_params: {}
          mode: chat
          name: claude-sonnet-4-20250514
          provider: langgenius/anthropic/anthropic
        prompt_template:
        - id: f30216e7-b889-45c8-b4d4-6fde6f94f661
          role: system
          text: 'You are ingesting a PolyU official webpage regarding campus facilities.
            Based on it, generate a list of Q&A pairs from the prospective students''
            perspective to help them get familiar with the facilities. Present the
            output as a Markdown table, where the first column 0 is Question, and
            the second column 1 is Answer. Ensure that the table format can be easily
            converted into a CSV file.

            Example Output Format:

            | 0 | 1 |

            |---|---|

            | What is the main purpose of the document? | The document explains the
            company''s new product launch strategy. ![image](https://cloud.dify.ai/files/xxxxxxx)
            |

            | When will the product be launched? | The product will be launched in
            Q3 of this year. |


            Instructions:

            In the first two rows, record the Source URL ({{#1774203856189.source_url#}})
            and As-of Date ({{#1774203708328.text#}}).

            Read and understand the input text.

            Extract key information and generate meaningful questions prospective
            students are likely to ask, along with corresponding answers.

            Preserve any ![image] URLs from the input text in the answers.

            Keep questions concise and specific.

            Ensure answers are accurate, self-contained, and clear.

            Output only the Markdown table without any extra explanation.

            Use ONLY the provided page content. Do NOT infer or invent. Keep precise
            link, date, time, amount, and so on. If information is missing, ignore
            it (do not guess).

            Ignore the virtual assistant and system warnings, such as Cookies and
            browser support.'
        - id: 63f7b3bf-3e2b-4c37-a011-df92652eb9a5
          role: user
          text: '{{#context#}}'
        selected: false
        title: LLM
        type: llm
        vision:
          enabled: false
      height: 88
      id: '1774203654631'
